{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时不再想两个人的以后，只想舒服地待在亲近里，但心思又慢慢飘远了。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、亲近、安静、恍惚、隐约迟疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间关于水波、暗流、声音滞留和思绪破碎的描写需要逐句读。右侧两条标签不够醒目。底部虽然字号大，但想表达喜欢、想确认对方心意、最终没开口的完整转折不一定一眼抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他享受两个人此刻的亲近，不想考虑以后，心里却有想表达的喜欢，又迟迟没有说出口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒适、亲近、心动、犹豫、恍惚\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间新增的短促急切声音出现又沉下去，以及后面水波、暗流、思绪破碎的具体意象，都需要读才能理解。底部关于想问对方是否也有同样感受、最后念头淡去的转折也不容易完整扫到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正安静地享受两个人的亲近，心里有很多喜欢和想确认的事，却没有真正说出来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、心动、安静、迟疑、失落感\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间三行描写的声音忽然出现又消失、水波仍在摇曳、思绪难以拼完整，需要逐句读。右侧关系标签依然很小，容易忽略。底部那句想说喜欢却最终没有开口的完整心理过程也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两条大字号长句分别放在上方和下方，中间又插入一段较小的氛围描写，三个区域都承载了重要信息。第一眼能抓到舒服、亲近和心思漂远，但不一定马上把享受亲近、想表达喜欢、犹豫而没有开口串成一个完整的心理过程。中间的声音和水波意象也需要读完才能明确挂到这个人的处境上。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b82776d8-07dc-41d8-a847-fa0c08ea3a1b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T000421738202Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:05:50.396093+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "27d1210ac500ddbba35c6cafa3f088c7674b020bb1a49bdf074d7914e1189566", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T000421738202Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f3e5d35f96bd401f399b8898c02c6f62fdf5519d6723f7fa3c6b8a0bd6b58478"}}}
